---
description: Qubix University repository-wide curriculum and engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/AGENT-ONBOARDING.md` before editing.

- Only the founder may mark curriculum `APPROVED` or `RELEASED`.
- Work on one small, explicitly requested BB or engineering task at a time.
- Keep production in staging/dummy mode unless the founder explicitly changes the release gate.
- Do not bulk-generate curriculum from the classical library.
- Audit the exact edition and territory status of source material before adaptation.
- Do not connect inherited Strata Vercel or Supabase resources without explicit approval.
- Build and test at desktop and mobile widths before handoff.
